==============================================================================
cycles NOT in unit cells (q, min|n|, k, s, D): [(3, -17, 11, 7, -139), (5, 1, 5, 2, 7), (5, 13, 7, 3, 3), (5, 17, 7, 3, 3), (181, 27, 15, 2, 7), (181, 35, 15, 2, 7)]
